  "description": "Yoo Sara wakes up inside a zombie-romance novel, stranded on an island as the hated villainess who shares her face, name, and none of her survival instincts. A corporate slave with no time for romance, she treats the outbreak like a deadline: read the room, manage the panic, reach the portal. But her sudden competence catches the wrong kind of attention, drawing in the male leads and the plot she wants nothing to do with. Too bad Sara’s only goal is to clock out of this nightmare alive!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
